	     with the write flag, as printed by the script itself).
	     ==========================================================================
	     A buying network whose identifier is absent here does not report installs at
	     all, so a short list silently under-counts iOS acquisition and makes every
	     paid test look worse than it was. Google publishes the authoritative list at
	     https://developers.google.com/admob/ios/3p-skadnetworks and adds to it over
	     time, which is why this is refreshed by a script rather than pasted once.
	     Below is Google's own identifier plus a partial set of buyers; the full
	     published list is several times longer. -->
	<key>SKAdNetworkItems</key>
